wf-armor-spec-spall-liner-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Spall Liner:[/color] Bullets that get through are caught by the liner, so they can't lodge in your body or leave shrapnel behind. There's nothing for a medic to dig out afterward.
wf-armor-spec-sealed-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Sealed Layer:[/color] Covered skin is sealed against acid and extreme cold, so you can't suffer chemical burns or frostbite there.
wf-armor-spec-sealed-spall-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Sealed Spall Liner:[/color] Covered skin is sealed against acid and extreme cold, so you can't suffer chemical burns or frostbite there. Bullets that get through are caught by the liner, so they can't lodge in your body or leave shrapnel behind.
wf-armor-spec-insulation-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Insulated:[/color] Electric shocks can't burn you internally, and synthetic wearers can't be short-circuited.
wf-armor-spec-insulation-crush-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Insulated and Crush-Rated:[/color] Electric shocks can't burn you internally, and synthetic wearers can't be short-circuited. Crushing blows need twice the usual force to cause a crush injury or internal bleeding.
wf-armor-spec-tendon-ward-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Tendon Guards:[/color] Blades can't sever your tendons, so a cut can't cripple your grip or your stride.
wf-armor-spec-concussion-ward-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Shock-Mounted Padding:[/color] Blows to the head can't concuss you.
wf-armor-spec-bone-plating-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Bone Plating:[/color] Crushing blows need twice the usual force to cause a crush injury, dislocate a joint, or start internal bleeding.
wf-armor-spec-shock-absorbers-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Shock Absorbers:[/color] Blunt impacts need twice the usual force to concuss you or bruise your organs.
wf-armor-spec-trauma-gel-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Trauma Gel:[/color] A gel layer seals around any cut or bullet that would reach an artery, so you can't suffer an arterial bleed.
wf-armor-spec-mining-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Cave-In Rated:[/color] Crushing blows need twice the usual force to cause a crush injury or bruise your organs.
wf-armor-spec-commander-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Commander's Weave:[/color] Shock-mounted padding means blows to the head can't concuss you, and a trauma gel layer seals around any cut or bullet that would reach an artery, so you can't suffer an arterial bleed.

wf-armor-spec-limb-lock-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Limb Lock:[/color] Your covered limbs can't be severed unless a single hit deals at least {$breakthrough} damage of one type.
wf-armor-spec-limb-lock-total-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Limb Lock:[/color] Nothing can sever your covered limbs, not even an explosion.
wf-armor-spec-pain-dampener-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Pain Dampener:[/color] Dulls pain about as well as a mild painkiller, helping you stay on your feet when wounded. It stacks with painkillers.
wf-armor-spec-ablative-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Ablative Coat ({$percent}% left):[/color] Absorbs half of incoming burn damage until the coat is spent. It recovers after a few seconds without being hit.
wf-armor-spec-tourniquet-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Auto-Tourniquet ({$charges}/{$max} charges):[/color] Automatically ties a tourniquet around a covered limb with an arterial bleed. Each tourniquet uses one charge, and charges recover over time. A medic can loosen it like any other tourniquet.
wf-armor-spec-tourniquet-popup = Your suit cinches a tourniquet tight around your limb!

wf-armor-spec-cold-sealed-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Cold-Sealed:[/color] Covered skin is sealed against extreme cold, so you can't suffer frostbite there.
wf-armor-spec-impact-dampers-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Impact Dampers:[/color] Being thrown or slammed into something can't dislocate your joints, and blunt impacts need twice the usual force to concuss you.
wf-armor-spec-overseer-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Spall Liner and Shock-Mounted Padding:[/color] Bullets that get through can't lodge in your body or leave shrapnel behind, and blows to the head can't concuss you.
wf-armor-spec-comedic-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Comedic Padding:[/color] Hits can't concuss you or dislocate your joints, and blunt hits honk.
wf-armor-spec-plush-lining-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Plush Lining:[/color] Soft padding dulls pain about as well as a mild painkiller, helping you stay on your feet when wounded. It stacks with painkillers.
wf-armor-spec-fire-rated-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Fire-Rated ({$percent}% left):[/color] Absorbs half of incoming heat damage until the lining is spent. It recovers after a few seconds away from the flames.

wf-armor-spec-plasma-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Plasma Reserve ({$units}/{$max}u):[/color] Holds universal synthetic plasma for your patients. Use "Transfuse from suit" on a patient beside you to run a line to them; it can't feed you. Refill it by using blood packs on the suit.
wf-armor-spec-plasma-verb-connect = Transfuse from suit
wf-armor-spec-plasma-verb-disconnect = Disconnect suit line
wf-armor-spec-plasma-connect-begin-others = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} starts running a plasma line into {THE($target)}.
wf-armor-spec-plasma-connected = You run your suit's plasma line into {THE($target)}.
wf-armor-spec-plasma-disconnected = The plasma line is taken out of {THE($target)}.
wf-armor-spec-plasma-line-pulled = The plasma line pulls free of {THE($target)}!
wf-armor-spec-plasma-cannot = You can't run a line to {THE($target)} from here.
wf-armor-spec-plasma-empty = Your suit's plasma reserve is empty.
wf-armor-spec-plasma-ran-dry = Your suit's plasma reserve runs dry and the line comes out.
wf-armor-spec-plasma-full = The plasma reserve is already full.
wf-armor-spec-plasma-refilled = You empty the blood pack into the plasma reserve ({$units}/{$max}u).

wf-armor-spec-steady-hands-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Steady Hands:[/color] Light hits won't interrupt your bandaging, splinting, suturing, tourniquets or surgery.
wf-armor-spec-sterile-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Sterile Weave:[/color] Wounds under the suit can't get infected, and wounds you treat are left clean.
wf-armor-spec-stasis-weave-examine-ready = [color=#8fb7d6]Emergency Stasis Weave (ready):[/color] If you go critical, the suit holds all your bleeding for a short while. It takes a few minutes to recharge.
wf-armor-spec-stasis-weave-examine-charging = [color=#8fb7d6]Emergency Stasis Weave (recharging):[/color] If you go critical, the suit holds all your bleeding for a short while. It takes a few minutes to recharge.
wf-armor-spec-stasis-weave-fired = The suit's stasis weave locks tight, holding the bleeding!
wf-armor-spec-servo-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Servo Assist:[/color] Your tool work (welding, prying, unbolting) goes {$percent}% faster.
wf-armor-spec-rad-sink-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Rad Sink:[/color] Absorbs {$percent}% of incoming radiation and slowly sheds the radiation you've already absorbed.
wf-armor-spec-emp-hardened-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]EMP-Hardened:[/color] EMPs can't drain or disable you or anything you're carrying.
wf-armor-spec-wildlife-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Wildlife Padding:[/color] Creatures such as carp, spiders and goliaths deal {$percent}% less damage to you.
wf-armor-spec-haul-frame-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Haul Frame:[/color] Dragging bodies, crates and machines doesn't slow you down.
wf-armor-spec-decon-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Decon Coating:[/color] Chemicals splashed, sprayed or spilled on you don't soak in, and neither does smoke or foam. Showers and antiseptic still work.
wf-armor-spec-blast-liner-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Blast Liner:[/color] Explosions can't take your covered limbs, bruise your organs or cause internal bleeding, though they still hurt.
wf-armor-spec-thrusters-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Emergency Thrusters:[/color] Gives you one thruster burst in zero gravity, pushing you the way you're facing. It takes a minute and a half to recharge.
wf-armor-spec-thrusters-gravity = Your thrusters only work in zero gravity.
wf-armor-spec-thrusters-fired = Your suit's thrusters fire!
wf-armor-spec-living-tissue-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Living Tissue:[/color] Small bleeding wounds under the suit close up on their own. Arterial bleeds still need a medic.
wf-armor-spec-vow-examine = [color=#8fb7d6]Vow of Silence:[/color] You make no sound when you're hurt, and your footsteps are muffled.
